 label "This 'Master Switch' has 2 switches.\n\nThe 1st is to switch between viewing renders from Houdini versions 22 & 21.\n\nh21 = 0 and h22 = 1 (1 is the default)\n\nThe 2nd switch is to compare between CPU and XPU\n\nCPU = 0 and XPU = 1 (0 is the default)\n\nThe renders are wrapped into groups.\n \nAs discribed in the wiki \nif you drop the 'render' folder \ninside the 'AOV_rebuild_karma_examples' folder\nthe render files should load automatically \n\nThis script was made in nuke 17 \nso you may need to updare the colorspace\nsetting for the read nodes inside groups\n\nKarma_All_AOVs\nKarma_All_Materials\nKarma_Default_Utils\nKarma_Extra_Utils\n\nto match the ACES config your version of Nuke is using."
